Input:   
1: Network   
2: Threshold   
Output: Communities   
// Step 1: Finding the communities $C =$ find_communities(Network)   
// Step 2: Classifying minority users into significant communities   
for $C_i$ in $C$ do if count $(C_i) >$ Threshold then Add $C_i$ to training set else Add $C_i$ to test set end if model $=$ train(training set)   
end for predictions $=$ model.inference(test set)   
for p in predictions do if p.label $= = C_{i}$ then Add p.data to $C_i$ end if   
end for   
return C

